  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to healthcare, emergency relief, and physical and mental rehabilitation services in the OPTs.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO support will contribute to the rehabilitation of healthcare services and providing people with medicines and medical supplies. People also reached with food distributions, and Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) support in Gaza and West Bank. To ensure inclusive programming and services, the project will target individuals with disabilities and those who need physical and mental rehabilitation by providing rehabilitation services, assisted devices, and supplies.</narrative>
  </description>
